{
  "id": "unique-event-037",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "unique-event-037:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "#37. Mark Tells a Story\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,368,392]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-037:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Mark tells you that there are two\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,392,426]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-037:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "groups of children and teens in\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,426,458]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-037:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "town. They used fight each other.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,458,492]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-037:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "They call themselves the Witch\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,492,523]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-037:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "children and the Halloween gang.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,523,556]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-037:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "The members of the Halloween\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,556,585]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-037:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Gang were older. The Witch\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,585,612]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-037:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "children were a group of bullied\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,612,645]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-037:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "children assembled and led by a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,645,677]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-037:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "girl called Eliza Dunforth. Eliza got\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,677,715]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-037:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Mirina, a talking doll, as a present\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,715,752]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-037:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "from Marjorie McAllister, a very\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,752,785]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-037:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "old lady from out of town.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,785,812]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-037:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Everybody said that this old lady\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,812,846]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-037:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "was a witch. Following instructions\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,846,882]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-037:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "from Mirina, Eliza found a book of\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,882,917]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-037:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "magic spells in a forest. She then\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,917,952]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-037:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "used these spells to punish the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,952,984]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-037:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Halloween Gang. But something\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,984,1014]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-037:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "went wrong. The magic she used\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,1014,1045]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-037:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "was too powerful for her to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,1045,1073]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-037:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "handle. Strange, dangerous doors\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,1073,1106]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-037:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "started to open into other places.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,1106,1141]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-037:p0024",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "The Halloween Gang got in contact\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,1141,1175]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-037:p0025",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "with some creatures who came\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,1175,1204]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-037:p0026",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "out of these doors, and started to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,1204,1239]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-037:p0027",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "do what they asked.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,1239,1259]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-037:p0028",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "If you want, you could go in the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,1259,1292]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-037:p0029",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "forest and check the place where,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,1292,1326]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-037:p0030",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "according to Mark’s story, Eliza\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,1326,1359]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-037:p0031",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "found her spell book. If you want\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,1359,1393]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-037:p0032",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "to do so, go to #41. If you do not\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,1393,1428]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-037:p0033",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "want to do so, continue with your\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,1428,1462]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-037:p0034",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "exploration of the town.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,1462,1487]]"
    }
  ],
